[00:38.20] And head into the bright new
[00:40.78] Beautiful day
[00:42.82] And the way she pulls me in
[00:46.00] Sucks my breath away
[00:49.88] I asked her for some time
[00:52.58] And she just made me it
[00:56.46] I asked her maybe why?
[00:59.54] And she just gave me it
[01:02.62] Never smile never stare
[01:06.24] She doesn't seem to care at all
[01:09.98] Never cry never scream
[01:13.36] She doesn't really seem
[01:15.50] To need me at all...
[01:19.60] Fourteen weeks I stay away from home
[01:35.98] A hundred days a part of me unknown
[01:40.16] A part in pink
[01:41.84] And perfect moments play
[01:44.80] And as a wonder of the world
[01:47.84] She sucks my breath away
